      <p class="hero-sub">
        The first word of every CMI assessment criterion is a command verb, and it tells you what your response
        must do. CMI's syllabuses say learners should make sure their responses fully address the command verbs
        in each criterion, and they define each verb in Annex 1. This guide explains the verbs that matter most,
        using CMI's definitions and counts taken from the Level 3 to Level 7 syllabuses.
      </p>
      <a href={whatsappUrl} class="btn btn-whatsapp btn-lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
